{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22485","headline":"庭松 · 白居易","name":"庭松","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"堂下何所有，十松当我阶。\n乱立无行次，高下亦不齐。\n高者三丈长，下者十尺低。\n有如野生物，不知何人栽。\n接以青瓦屋，承之白沙台。\n朝昏有风月，燥湿无尘泥。\n疎韵秋槭槭，凉阴夏凄凄。\n春深微雨夕，满叶珠蓑蓑。\n岁暮大雪天，压枝玉皑皑。\n四时各有趣，万木非其侪。\n去年买此宅，多爲人所咍。\n一家二十口，移转就松来。\n移来有何得，但得烦襟开。\n即此是益友，岂必交贤才。\n顾我犹俗士，冠带走尘埃。\n未称爲松主，时时一媿怀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22485.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22485","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}